WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.460
Are you not curious?

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:02.700
There's only one hope.

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.300
There's been whispers

00:00:11.275 --> 00:00:12.275
Of a thief.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.320
He's got our commoners looking up seeing hope.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:26.020
If I may

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.920
I propose a bounty

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.540
A thousand a week until he's caught.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:34.080
Or kill him.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.980
I've never seen anything like you.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.080
You stared death in the face.

00:00:40.455 --> 00:00:41.885
That's why I chose you.

00:00:44.925 --> 00:00:46.185
Am I curious?

00:00:48.785 --> 00:00:49.975
Who's under the hood?

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.100
He's obviously well trained

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.060
You flatter him, he's a smash and grabber

00:00:59.060 --> 00:00:59.680
Nothing more.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.440
Who do you think the thief is?

00:01:03.915 --> 00:01:05.285
He's all of us.

00:01:06.785 --> 00:01:07.785
You are an admirer?

00:01:08.115 --> 00:01:09.165
He has his qualities.

00:01:11.245 --> 00:01:12.295
He's not you.

00:01:13.255 --> 00:01:14.405
Are you sure?

00:01:31.315 --> 00:01:32.315
You are a crusader.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:35.160
Now

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:36.920
You have to be a warrior.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:39.500
You wanted to steal?

00:01:40.195 --> 00:01:41.195
Now's your time.

00:01:52.125 --> 00:01:53.125
Was that supposed to happen?

00:01:53.435 --> 00:01:54.435
Yeah, of course.

